      "standard_id": "RSML",
      "name": "RootSystemML (RSML)",
      "description": "An XML-based file format/metadata standard for representing plant root system architecture and related image metadata. RSML captures 2D/3D image metadata, plant and root properties and geometries, continuous functions along root paths, annotations at image/plant/root scales, and time-series data; it provides an XSD for validation and is implemented by analysis, modeling and data-analysis tools."
    }
